      "concern": "Source locator at items/def-fi-coinvariant-functors-and-transition-maps.md:30 describes CE​​FN Definition 2.4 and Lemma 2.5 as 'the same coinvariant quotient in the $H_0$ notation'. They concern a different functor: H₀(V)_S quotients V_S by images from smaller sets, whereas Φₐ quotients by moving-block group relations. For the constant free module M(0), H₀(M(0))ₙ=0 for n>0 but Φ₀(M(0))ₙ=k. Verified in [FI-modules over Noetherian rings](https://www.math.uchicago.edu/~farb/papers/FImodNoetherian.pdf), Definition 2.4 and complete Lemma 2.5 proof, PDF page 11. The local Definition is sound; the secondary source description is inaccurate.",
